{"about_the_game":"Gunhound EX is the PC version of the cult PSP mech action release that pits players' armored Gunhound mechs against scores of mechanized military foes.<br><br>In the search for a new renewable resource, humanity has discovered a powerful new one: neutron polymer. Integral to the expansion of modern society, alliances form and shatter as countries jockey to get their hands on the resource. A small southeast Asian nation is in the throes of civil war, but its concentrated deposits of neutron polymer are about to make the conflict a worldwide affair.<br><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Eliminate robotic foes with your Gunhound across multiple stages of mayhem. <br></li><li>360 degree aiming for precision strikes.<br></li><li>Unlock armor, weapons and more as you play the game<br></li><li>The PSP cult hit, available on PC for the first time!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chief Petty Officer First Class","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273240/cfeae67254eb1b5e4ad7a8a45110e5e370ee4584.jpg"},{"name":"Corporal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273240/3ea76141533ebdf5911d0d96a7e0eb76c029d6f3.jpg"},{"name":"Sergeant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273240/9f0cc3768414eea0e3bdd4d660ee4cdc410cecff.jpg"},{"name":"Sergeant Major","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273240/4e9461af6ba65d97fc53abf8007847ec28f1f90b.jpg"},{"name":"Second Lieutenant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273240/13a3ed4408ecedf805c3564c310e3102c7f805e2.jpg"},{"name":"First Lieutenant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273240/d9cccade55cb3c0a887185a0d1bc58ca962d8ecf.jpg"},{"name":"Captain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273240/7ef8308e53e08d69929dc6f1e57fa